      river.WorkerDefaults[jobs.FanoutArgs]
      DB   DB
      Jobs *river.Client[pgx.Tx] // inserts SendArgs (Queue = channel) in the fan-out transaction
      Now  func() time.Time      // asOf for AudienceQuery
      Log  *slog.Logger
