  //   409 version_conflict: not the latest revision, or a stale version
  //   409 no_recipients (new code): sms_eligible + email_eligible == 0
  //   409 invalid_transition: wrong state; any 409 for another campaign's revision
  //   422: /revision_id required|invalid_type, /version required, unknown_property; 401; 404
