  //   {"channels":{"sms":{...},"email":{...}}}, each with the keys
  //   queued, retrying, sending, sent, failed, dead, skipped (all present, zeros included)
  // GET /api/campaigns/{id}/messages?filter=attention
  //   {"messages":[{id, channel, state, attempts, reason, last_error_class,
